// REQUIRES: long
// P03.24 Done-when size for the operator checks, shape `mixed`: a generated
// program of size 100000 checks without a crash and in near-linear time
// (Inputs/check-linear.py: N/16 and N, N at most 48 times the CPU time; a
// quadratic check takes 256 times, also
// in the ASan build). One test per shape so lit runs the
// shapes in parallel. The parser allows 1024 levels of nesting, so a chain of
// operands is cut into expressions of 1000 operands (the same limit holds for
// an `int` sum).
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-linear.py --label ops-stress-mixed --out %t.lin1 --n 100000 --gen "%S/Inputs/gen-ops-stress.py mixed {n}" -- %gopp check -check-j=1 --check-error-limit=0 {file}
package main
